EvoMem3D training and evaluation release


Our code builds on the same enviroment of SEPatch3D.
Installation and data preparation:
https://github.com/Mingqj/SEPatch3D#get-started
Upstream reference revision: 4a5111f417b68f78dda1fb667ac56a954e587c4a.


The detector infrastructure also incorporates work from StreamPETR,
PETR/DETR3D, MMDetection, MMCV, MMDetection3D, EVA, and FlashAttention:
https://github.com/exiawsh/StreamPETR
https://github.com/megvii-research/PETR
https://github.com/WangYueFt/detr3d
https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmdetection
https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmcv
https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmdetection3d
https://github.com/baaivision/EVA
https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention

